<p nodeId="4a7a5d8f46cb4225ba3cb474f787ab87"><span font-size="14"><strong>【拨测任务成功率查看】</strong></span></p>
<ol nodeId="81587113de3e44d69becabdb4e558a5d">
<li nodeId="3a58a051e9b148bab2220226b5076ad6">
<p nodeId="f049b3703de945f3a922789f1ee3e85a"><span font-size="14">拨测状态：一条规则可以配置多个拨测，在规则场景页面（即规则维度），展示的拨测状态为这条规则配置的所有拨测任务的汇总状态，</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">共计四个状态，优先级：Running</span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14"> &gt; </span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">Debug</span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14"> &gt; </span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">Down</span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14"> &gt; None</span></span></p>
<ol nodeId="e73640b8f97c43ec9b79e5c89d382f27">
<li nodeId="b0b4381534c44cc090bf82e9f132e951"><span font-size="14">None：表示该规则没有配置任何一条任务；</span></li>
<li nodeId="4498af1594024fdb8e4eca3c8a7c1819"><span font-size="14">Down：表示该规则配置过拨测任务但当前所有任务均为Down状态；</span></li>
<li nodeId="3e1f293e934e42e09cac7111e0e8fe23"><span font-size="14">Debug：表示该规则配置过拨测任务但当前任务状态没有Running状态的；</span></li>
<li nodeId="c832620b0e36457badd10253a7ca0200"><span font-size="14">Running：表示该规则配置过拨测任务且当前任务状态有Running状态的；</span></li>
<li nodeId="e293be4468884eee99d6508d610fd30a"><span font-size="14">任务维度则展示该任务的状态，只有</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">Running</span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14"> 、</span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">Debug</span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14">、 </span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">Down</span></span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="7a9f6d1896e34fa991345a36ed163e93">
<p nodeId="36352a0e03e04907967c7553a3556d29"><span font-size="14">拨测成功率：计算公式为：</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">RUNNING 拨测用例成功数 /  RUNNING 拨测用例总数</span></span></p>
<ol nodeId="66ca841df6564f28ac43a0e849d7350c">
<li nodeId="54f31268844f447eb8952b4b4ee45a04"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">规则维度：成功率=该规则在该场景下统计时点所有状态=running的任务过去24h的sucess的用例数/该规则在该场景下统计时点所有状态=running的任务24h的用例数</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="90af706078fb4ee081f12e96382905fe"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">任务维度：成功率=统计时点状态=running的任务过去24h的sucess的用例数/统计时点状态=running的任务24h的用例数</span></span></li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="aa5bda88f55f4d1396af4fefb1e1100d"><br /></p>
