<p nodeId="ed317b255cd34575878568f2a17034fd" />
<p nodeId="1d912ecc59a64ce4afb33011c4973f10" />
<ol nodeId="6e7846beb3804c119b6bd1b882e7507d">
<li nodeId="1b1ce85cabf94f85808a0eeb13e82705">
<p nodeId="a87224ac2f6a44c6a1b64eebb2577329"><span font-size="14">已治理：</span></p>
<ol nodeId="49a45d5070684f4ba4eaf208937a9415">
<li nodeId="4752b1835692479ca81d9e5fa191c44b"><span font-size="14">所有已治理的告警均会从未治理转到已治理模块；</span></li>
<li nodeId="f2e0be36fb6545fc83725cf3e2bd338b"><span font-size="14">已治理的查询区比未治理多了「处理方式」和「misid」</span></li>
<li nodeId="466233c069a2400fbe133e72f0914d4a">
<p nodeId="e0fe2ab07c6948dca3f6090065f482e6"><span font-size="14">列表项比未治理多了告警原因、处理方式、告警跟进人和跟进事件、时效</span></p>
<ol nodeId="35bb8dc888344852adfef7c777942397">
<li nodeId="82eaf09b8d324f66a3738dc3a0125aec"><span font-size="14">告警原因为用户在告警治理时所填写的告警原因，如果用户选择快速解决，则无告警原因</span></li>
<li nodeId="89a36e2bc04b42ccb0abb2f1564cce48"><span font-size="14">处理方式为用户在告警治理时所选择的处理方式</span></li>
<li nodeId="07b53d6d10644d61b3005279f5440cc5"><span font-size="14">告警跟进人为进行告警治理的用户的misid和进行告警治理的时间</span></li>
<li nodeId="1076769a649846af866b73230a0152d1"><span font-size="14">时效：为告警报出到被治理的时间，精确到小时，四舍五入计算</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
